    <briefdescription>
<para>AES GCM <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1Stream" kindref="compound">Stream</ref> format constants. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>AGS1 stores the block length in its header. This implementation only reads and writes 1 MiB blocks, matching Java, rather than supporting other block lengths.</para>
<para>For Java compatibility, an empty file contains one zero-length plaintext block with a nonce and tag. The AGS1 spec describes a non-empty last block and does not explicitly define this empty-file representation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
